#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:9
msgid "组合控制与智能器件"
msgstr "Compose control and smart devices"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:11
msgid ""
"本指南帮助外部应用选择已有 I/O、算法和器件组件，明确执行者、存储、预算与退出。 当前生产 SoC 为 STM32F4；下述 PWM/ADC 路线仅是"
" STM32F407ZGT6 的精确软件参考。 它不替产品选择功率板、控制稳定性、私有 PCB、存储分区或调度，也不建立实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"This guide helps external applications select existing I/O, algorithms and "
"device components, with explicit executors, storage, budgets and shutdown. "
"The current production SoC is STM32F4; the PWM/ADC route below is an exact "
"STM32F407ZGT6 software reference. It does not select a power board, control "
"stability, private PCB, storage partitions or scheduling for the product, or"
" establish hardware qualification."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:15
msgid "1. 先划分执行与资源"
msgstr "1. Separate execution and resources first"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:17
msgid ""
"![FIG-34：调用者拥有控制与智能器件的执行及退出](../assets/diagrams/control-smart-devices.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-34: Caller-owned execution and shutdown for control and smart "
"devices](../assets/diagrams/control-smart-devices.svg)"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:17
msgid "FIG-34：调用者拥有控制与智能器件的执行及退出"
msgstr ""
"FIG-34: Caller-owned execution and shutdown for control and smart devices"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:19
msgid ""
"FIG-34 是当前软件组合图。实线表示调用／执行，虚线表示借用或退出责任；不表示 每个应用必须启用全部节点。图源与源码依据见{ref}`图册 "
"<fig-34-control-smart-devices>`。"
msgstr ""
"FIG-34 describes the current software composition. Solid edges represent "
"calls/execution; dashed edges represent borrowing or shutdown duties. "
"Applications need not enable every node. See the {ref}`diagram catalogue "
"<fig-34-control-smart-devices>` for the source and code basis."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "执行路径"
msgstr "Execution path"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "放置内容"
msgstr "What belongs here"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "不得从该路径推导"
msgstr "What this path does not imply"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "普通任务"
msgstr "Ordinary task"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "位置环、器件采样、命令校验、参数快照、GUI、协议 service"
msgstr ""
"Position loop, device sampling, command validation, parameter snapshots, GUI"
" and protocol service"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "调用间隔就是实际采样孔径，或接口可直接从 IRQ 使用"
msgstr ""
"The call interval is the physical sample aperture, or the interface can be "
"used directly from IRQ"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "选定 ADC IRQ"
msgstr "Selected ADC IRQ"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "完整 raw scan、已预算的 compute、完整 duty 组提交"
msgstr "Complete raw scan, budgeted compute and complete duty-group commit"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "能阻塞、写 Flash、运行网络／GUI，或并发修改借用算法状态"
msgstr ""
"Permission to block, write Flash, run networking/GUI or concurrently change "
"borrowed algorithm state"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "外部维护流程"
msgstr "External maintenance flow"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "Settings 保存、文件耐久、镜像请求／确认、恢复"
msgstr ""
"Settings saves, file durability, image requests/confirmation and recovery"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "超时撤销持久效果、自动重放或自动重新使能输出"
msgstr ""
"Timeout revokes persistent effects, or automatically replays operations or "
"re-enables outputs"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:28
msgid ""
"TOML 选择精确控制器、模式和已审 Board 路线。使用 [应用配置](app-configuration.md)与 [I/O 执行指南](io-"
"execution.md)，不要在业务中 复写 SDK 初始化或重新取得同一 controller owner。"
msgstr ""
"TOML selects exact controllers, modes and reviewed Board routes. Follow "
"[application configuration](app-configuration.md) and [I/O execution](io-"
"execution.md); do not duplicate SDK initialization or acquire the same "
"controller owner again in business code."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:31
msgid ""
"CMake 选择实际组件 target。依赖库只在明确选择时准备／编译；普通器件 C 库可以 直接链接。厂商结构和 Handle 不进入业务接口。"
msgstr ""
"CMake selects the actual component targets. Supplier libraries are "
"prepared/compiled only when explicitly selected; ordinary device C libraries"
" may be linked directly. Vendor structures and Handles do not enter business"
" interfaces."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:33
msgid ""
"为每个实例提供独立状态、缓冲、有限 deadline、同一 domain/epoch 的时间与 一个执行者。跨任务消息使用应用已有的有界 "
"queue/guard，不把普通字段当原子快照。"
msgstr ""
"Provide independent state, buffers, finite deadlines, time in one "
"domain/epoch and one executor for each instance. Transfer cross-task "
"messages through the existing bounded application queue/guard; ordinary "
"fields are not an atomic snapshot."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:35
msgid "先按下面的路径完成启停，再接入遥测、GUI、网络和持久化；慢消费者不得延长硬件 借用或在 IRQ 中调用慢路径。"
msgstr ""
"Complete startup and shutdown on the paths below before adding telemetry, "
"GUI, networking and persistence. Slow consumers must not extend hardware "
"borrowing or call slow paths from IRQ."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:38
msgid "2. 选择任务位置环或硬件耦合窗口"
msgstr "2. Choose a task position loop or a coupled hardware window"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:40
msgid ""
"任务位置环使用独立 encoder、计数展开、标定、轨迹、PID 和 PWM group。输入包含 单位、sequence、epoch、有效期及完整参数"
" revision。轨迹 READY 只表示命令计算 完成，不表示机构到位；新位置范围同时约束当前测量与仍在保持的目标。参数在一个 "
"周期边界整体切换，保存只在控制源已退出后显式执行。"
msgstr ""
"The task position loop uses an independent encoder, count expansion, "
"calibration, trajectory, PID and PWM group. Inputs include units, sequence, "
"epoch, validity and a complete parameter revision. Trajectory READY means "
"command calculation completed, not that the mechanism reached its target; "
"new position limits constrain both the current measurement and a target "
"still being held. Parameters switch together at one cycle boundary, and "
"saving is explicit only after control sources withdraw."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:45
msgid ""
"编码器软件观察时间不等于边沿时间。有界计数展开依赖产品证明的最大单步位移，不能 补回漏掉的完整圈数。位置环遵守公共 encoder/waveform "
"的任务上下文，不作为 IRQ 电流环使用。具体 API "
"见[算法](../reference/api/components/algorithms.md)。"
msgstr ""
"An encoder software observation is not an edge timestamp. Bounded count "
"expansion depends on a product-proven maximum displacement per step; it "
"cannot recover missed complete wraps. The position loop follows the public "
"encoder/waveform task-context requirements and is not an IRQ current loop. "
"See the [algorithm APIs](../reference/api/components/algorithms.md)."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:49
msgid ""
"需要统一 PWM/ADC 硬件节拍时，选择一个独立 `pwm_adc` controller，不能再分别占用 同一 TIM8、ADC 共享域或 "
"DMA。两种模式的接口和状态分离："
msgstr ""
"For one coherent PWM/ADC hardware schedule, select a separate `pwm_adc` "
"controller. Do not independently claim the same TIM8, ADC shared domain or "
"DMA. The two modes have separate interfaces and state:"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "模式"
msgstr "Mode"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "用途"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "调用者责任"
msgstr "Caller responsibility"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "`finite-regular-dma`"
msgstr "`finite-regular-dma`"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "固定 duty 的有限采样窗口"
msgstr "Finite sampling window with fixed duty"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "request、duty 和 DMA 可达 samples 保持至 acquire 观察 SETTLED；显式推进 service"
msgstr ""
"Keep request, duty and DMA-reachable samples live until acquire-observed "
"SETTLED; explicitly advance service"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "`injected-control`"
msgstr "`injected-control`"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "有有限生命周期的 IRQ compute session"
msgstr "Finite-lifetime IRQ compute session"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "固定 raw scan／完整 duty 数量，独占借用 context，并证明 IRQ 与 compute 预算"
msgstr ""
"Fix raw-scan/complete-duty counts, lend context exclusively, and establish "
"IRQ and compute budgets"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:57
msgid ""
"连续参考固定 timer 为 1 MHz。配置校验 trigger、conversion、最大 IRQ 延迟、compute 与 commit "
"窗口，并包含明确量化裕量。该校验不测量物理 WCET。ADC IRQ callback 不能保存临时 scan/output 指针，也不能调用 "
"task-only I/O、OS、文件或网络。给快环 更新目标时，只通过另一个有独立同步合同的有界消息对象交接；不能逐字段修改已借用 的 "
"PID／session。详细公式、精确引脚与退出见 [耦合 owner](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/pwm_adc/README.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The continuous reference fixes the timer at 1 MHz. Configuration checks "
"trigger, conversion, maximum IRQ delay, compute and commit windows, "
"including an explicit quantization margin. These checks do not measure "
"physical WCET. The ADC IRQ callback must not retain temporary scan/output "
"pointers or call task-only I/O, OS, file or network methods. Update fast-"
"loop targets only through a separate bounded message object with its own "
"synchronization contract; do not change borrowed PID/session fields "
"individually. See the [coupled owner](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/pwm_adc/README.md) for exact equations, "
"pins and shutdown."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:64
msgid ""
"ST MCSDK 6.4.2 官方原始包尚未取得，复用工作保持 `blocked`。已实现的通用数值与 PWM/ADC owner 不构成官方 "
"MCSDK、FOC、功率级保护或电机调参能力声明。"
msgstr ""
"The official original ST MCSDK 6.4.2 package has not been obtained, so reuse"
" remains `blocked`. The implemented generic numeric mechanisms and PWM/ADC "
"owner do not establish official MCSDK, FOC, power-stage protection or motor-"
"tuning capabilities."

