msgid "capture/PCM owner、真实数据线、时钟、缓冲与带宽；启明参考只有控制连接授权"
msgstr ""
"Capture/PCM owner, actual data lines, clocks, buffers and bandwidth; the "
"Qiming reference authorizes control connections only"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
