msgstr "`Nexus::ATECC608B`, `Nexus::IOP256Signer`"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:0
msgid "已 provision/锁定的精确 B 器件与 slot、wake/delay 和有限操作 scope"
msgstr ""
"Exact already-provisioned/locked B device and slot, wake/delay and finite "
"operation scope"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:79
msgid ""
"器件方法成功只建立各自数字合同。AS5047P 的两帧流水线不能取旧响应冒充当前角度； 普通 SPI endpoint 的存在也不证明 CS "
"纳秒约束。LSM6DSOX 的 DIRECT 与 FIFO 各有 数据含义，不把分离 tagged 记录强行配成同一采样。选定 P256 API "
"不导出私钥、不做 provisioning，也没有因此完成 TLS opaque-key 集成。精确模式、单位和失败责任见 "
"[器件参考](../reference/api/components/devices.md)。"
msgstr ""
"A successful device method establishes only its own digital contract. The "
"AS5047P two-frame pipeline must not present an old response as the current "
"angle; an ordinary SPI endpoint does not prove the CS nanosecond "
"constraints. LSM6DSOX DIRECT and FIFO have separate data meanings; do not "
"force separate tagged records into one sample. The selected P256 API does "
"not export private keys or perform provisioning, and does not complete TLS "
"opaque-key integration. See the [device "
"reference](../reference/api/components/devices.md) for exact modes, units "
"and failure duties."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:85
msgid "4. 接入界面、通信与持久化"
msgstr "4. Add user interface, communications and persistence"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:87
msgid "从控制路径复制带有效性、时间来源和参数版本的观察，再由普通执行者处理："
msgstr ""
"Copy observations with validity, time provenance and parameter version from "
"the control path, then process them in an ordinary executor:"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:89
msgid ""
"CANopen OD 是原始 staging；NMT Operational 和 SDO/PDO 写入都不是产品命令 授权。外层检查完整命令后再交给控制"
" owner。协议 reset／overrun 关闭准入，不重置 MCU，也不重放旧目标。"
msgstr ""
"CANopen OD values are raw staging. Neither NMT Operational nor SDO/PDO "
"writes authorize product commands. Validate the whole command before passing"
" it to the control owner. Protocol reset/overrun closes admission without "
"resetting the MCU or replaying old targets."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:92
msgid ""
"ESP-AT 复用已有 UARTByteStream。显式推进 UART service 与模块 service；复制 "
"写入成功不等于线上完成，`SEND OK` 不等于 peer 收到。CLOSED 后先真实恢复模块／ UART 边界，再重新 configure；TLS"
" 信任、时间和熵保持外部策略。"
msgstr ""
"ESP-AT reuses the existing UARTByteStream. Explicitly advance UART and "
"module service. Successful copying is not wire completion; `SEND OK` does "
"not mean peer receipt. After CLOSED, actually restore the module/UART "
"boundary before configuring again. TLS trust, time and entropy remain "
"external policy."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:95
msgid ""
"LVGL 只保留一个 live GUI owner。调用者提供私有 arena、32 KiB pool 与 RGB565 tile，同一任务推进 "
"UI。display/input 回调必须同步结清；任意异步 DMA flush 不能 直接替换这个合同。上游 arena 子分配和耗尽 fail-"
"stop 也纳入完整页面预算。"
msgstr ""
"LVGL permits one live GUI owner. The caller supplies a private arena, 32 KiB"
" pool and RGB565 tile; one task advances the UI. Display/input callbacks "
"must settle synchronously; an arbitrary asynchronous DMA flush cannot "
"replace this contract. Include upstream arena suballocation and exhaustion "
"fail-stop in the complete page budget."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:98
msgid ""
"LittleFS／FatFs 用固定块 `read_at`／`append` 处理文件，无 VFS 或全局句柄池。 失败时的 prefix "
"不证明耐久，也不授权重放；close/unmount 失败保持原 volume 和 workspace。远端 ACK、重复消除、retention "
"与断网队列归外部产品。"
msgstr ""
"LittleFS/FatFs use fixed chunks through `read_at`/`append`, with no VFS or "
"global handle pool. An error prefix does not establish durability or "
"authorize replay; close/unmount failure retains the original volume and "
"workspace. Remote ACK, deduplication, retention and offline queues belong to"
" the external product."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:101
msgid ""
"MCUboot overwrite-only 与 scratch swap 分开选择。TEST 后由产品核对运行镜像和 健康结果，再显式 "
"confirm；没有确认就重启可触发选定 revert。共享布局文件拥有 Flash 几何，不能把参考地址直接复制进已有产品分区。"
msgstr ""
"Select MCUboot overwrite-only and scratch swap separately. After TEST, the "
"product checks the running image and health before explicit confirmation; "
"reboot without confirmation can trigger the selected revert. The shared "
"layout file owns Flash geometry; do not copy reference addresses into an "
"existing product partition scheme."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:105
msgid ""
"详细合同见[协议与字节会话](../reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md)、 "
"[存储服务](../reference/api/components/services.md)与 "
"[MCUboot](../reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [protocol and byte "
"sessions](../reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md), [storage "
"services](../reference/api/components/services.md) and "
"[MCUboot](../reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md) for complete "
"contracts."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:109
msgid "5. 按责任退出"
msgstr "5. Shut down by responsibility"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:111
msgid "关闭新目标、UI 命令和网络准入，停止产生新的快照／请求。"
msgstr ""
"Close admission for new targets, UI commands and networking, and stop "
"producing new snapshots/requests."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:112
msgid ""
"在各自 executor 调用 stop/service，等待真实硬件源、IRQ callback 与接受的 request 退出。失败保持原 "
"instance、buffer、callback 和恢复责任；不直接清零状态。"
msgstr ""
"Call stop/service in each executor and wait for actual hardware sources, IRQ"
" callbacks and accepted requests to withdraw. Failure retains the original "
"instance, buffers, callbacks and recovery duties; do not simply zero the "
"state."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:114
msgid ""
"acquire 观察 SETTLED 后才结束对应借用；另外会合 observer、widget、协议与外部 调用者。输出抑制和引用退出分别判断。"
msgstr ""
"End each borrow only after acquire-observed SETTLED. Separately join "
"observers, widgets, protocols and external callers. Check output inhibition "
"and reference withdrawal independently."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:116
msgid ""
"停 capture/PCM 后再停 sensor/codec；GUI stop 后再退出显示／触摸；上层网络退出 后再停 UART "
"stream；最后关闭 bus 与 Platform 的 cold 资源。"
msgstr ""
"Stop capture/PCM before the sensor/codec; stop GUI before display/touch; "
"stop upper network consumers before the UART stream. Finally close the buses"
" and Platform cold resources."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:118
msgid ""
"持久化或 Flash 操作失败可能已有效果。按原 owner 合同恢复并核对实际状态，不能 通过重新初始化软件或延长 deadline 抹去责任。"
msgstr ""
"Persistence or Flash failures may already have effects. Recover under the "
"original owner contract and inspect actual state; software reinitialization "
"or an extended deadline cannot erase those duties."

