#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/control-and-smart-devices.md:134
msgid ""
"阅读示例时使用该仓库交付记录绑定的精确提交与 Nexus 依赖，不从 `main` 的后续变化 继承资格。本仓库 "
"`tests/contracts/f407_pwm_adc` 和 `f407_pwm_adc_loop` 提供真实 TOML、typed factory"
" 与 ARM 链接入口；它们是 cold consumer，不执行实板快环。 Native 行为、ARM 链接与实板测量分别记录；物理 HIL 仍为 "
"`not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"Read examples at the exact commit and Nexus dependency bound by that "
"repository's delivery record; do not inherit qualification from later `main`"
" changes. This repository's `tests/contracts/f407_pwm_adc` and "
"`f407_pwm_adc_loop` provide real TOML, typed factories and ARM-link entry "
"points. They are cold consumers and do not run hardware fast loops. Native "
"behavior, ARM linking and hardware measurement remain separate; physical HIL"
" is still `not_executed`."
